}}'''Soda''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] gun that that is currently obtainable in the [[Summer Event 2025]] by purchasing the 10th tier in the Battle Pass for 800  [[Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} in the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]], or through trading.

== Appearance ==
The barrel of this gun is a light shaded lime green, it gradually darkens near the grip. There are multiple lemon slices on it as well, located at different parts of the gun. In addition, there is a can of soda, near its grip, hence the name.

